# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Olympus .gitignore
# This repo tracks problem SUBMISSIONS + authoring docs, not code or binaries.
# Anything large, machine-local, or re-clonable/re-buildable stays out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Cloned target repositories (CLAUDE.md: "worktrees/ is git-ignored so cloned
# repos never pollute the Olympus repo history"). ~4G here.
worktrees/

# Local language toolchains consolidated under the project (~4.8G):
# Go SDK/GOPATH/GOCACHE, Rust cargo+rustup, m2, gradle standin, venvs.
.toolchains/

# Local Gradle distribution + cache used for JVM targets (~250M)
.gradle-local/
.gradle/

# --- Build / dependency output (target repos or local experiments) ---
target/
build/
dist/
node_modules/
vendor/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
*.a
*.class
*.jar

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# --- Rust / Go / JS caches ---
Cargo.lock.bak
go.work.sum
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.npm/
.yarn/

# --- Agent run artifacts (batch exhaust) ---
# Saved platform rollout artifacts: trajectories, test logs, workspace diffs,
# JUnit XML, per-run verdicts. 834M of the 872M working tree, write-once and
# never diffed, so git is the wrong store for them. The mined CONCLUSIONS are
# already tracked in feedback.md / eval-results.md / failure-patterns.md.
# These stay on disk and keep getting written here - back them up out of band.
agent-runs/
agent-runs*/
Nova_Nova*/
Orion_Nova*/
Vega_*/
Castor_*/

# --- Test / eval scratch output ---
# JUnit XML and run logs written locally during validation; the platform
# regenerates these.
*.junit.xml
test-output/
/tmp-*/
scratch/
scratchpad/

# --- Claude Code local state (skills, hooks and settings.json ARE tracked) ---
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.credentials.json
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/shell-snapshots/

# --- Editor / OS junk ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# --- Secrets / local env ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
